# Security Triage (Weekly)

## Cadence

- Follow [`docs/SECURITY_TRIAGE.md`](../../docs/SECURITY_TRIAGE.md)
- Triage OpenSSF Scorecard SARIF findings into BUILD_PLAN `[AGENT]` rows when actionable

## Gates

- Zero open Critical/High Dependabot alerts before release (or documented `[HUMAN]` exception)
- Required workflows green: **Toolchain verify**, **Security scan**, **CodeQL**
- Scorecard is informational until `[HUMAN]` enables it as a required check

## Batch

Use `/dependabot` or `/triage` for maintenance passes.
